sole and outsole compositions are not specified. Minimum order: 2 pairs. Send your quantities by color and size, destination and packing requirements for a quotation. Standard non-custom lead time is estimated at 7 days and confirmed for the selected order. No stock quantity, tested sporting performance or model-specific customization is promised.</value></field><field id="companyFaqDesc" type="multiComplex"><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>What materials are used in this model?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>Upper, lining, midsole and outsole compositions are not specified in the product information. Confirm the material requirements for your selected order before purchase.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>Which colors can I choose?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>Choose Black / Red, Yellow or Sky Blue from the actual product photos. Each color has its own matching product image; decorative markings shown in the photos are retained.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>What sizes are listed?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>The listed size labels are 38 through 50. The sizing system is unspecified. Please confirm measurements and send your quantities by color and size before ordering.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>Is this a tested performance basketball shoe?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>This is a basketball-style casual sneaker with wavy textured upper panels, laces and pull tabs. Tested sports performance, grip, cushioning and protective functions are not claimed.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>What are the minimum order and quantity prices?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>Minimum order: 2 pairs. 2-49 pairs: USD 19.03/pair; 50-99 pairs: USD 17.76/pair; 100+ pairs: USD 16.49/pair. Freight and packing are confirmed for your order.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>How are dispatch and order requirements confirmed?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>Standard non-custom orders use a 7-day estimated lead time, subject to confirmation for your selected colors, sizes and quantities. This is not a stock guarantee. Send your destination and packing requirements for an order quotation.</value></field></complex-values></field><field id="pkgMeasure" type="complex"><complex-value><field id="length" type="input"><value>34</value></field><field id="width" type="input"><value>23</value></field><field id="height" type="input"><value>13</value></field></complex-value></field><field id="pkgWeight" type="input"><value>0.5</value></field></itemSchema>